  m_BlockDisplayName: Venture Inline Swivel
  m_BlockDescription: 'A swivel which''s center disk rotates blocks, while it is held
    by the top or bottom. And it''s fast, too. That''s because it''s packed full of
    dense planetary motors, that have the incredible capability of breaking all known
    laws of thermodynamics

    Right click to configure this block.


    This is a BlockMover. Blocks attached to the head of this will have their own
    physics separate from the body they are on, yet still restrained to the same tech.
    Like a multi-tech, but a single tech. ClusterTech.'
